## Additional Execution Notes

- Execute settlement test cases only if the API or test environment supports the relevant WIN/LOSS workflow.
- Confirm payout calculations and settlement rules against the actual game specification.
- Use an isolated test account and record the initial and final wallet balances.
- For interruption and concurrency scenarios, verify both database consistency and the API response.
- Mark unsupported scenarios as Not Applicable (N/A), and unexecuted scenarios as Not Run. Do not mark a test as Passed without evidence.
